// BC-MYPOS-004: provider-neutral identifier for which payment gateway a
// Subscription/PendingSubscription's providerOrderId belongs to. STRIPE_LEGACY
// covers Stripe-originated Subscription rows, which also keep their own
// dedicated columns (stripeSubscriptionId etc.) as the historical source of
// truth — migration 20260819120100_backfill_and_constrain_payment_provider
// backfills paymentProvider='STRIPE_LEGACY'/providerOrderId=stripeSubscriptionId
// for every Subscription row with a non-null stripeSubscriptionId not already
